Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"postgresql__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（单机综合性能强；复杂查询优化器是长板）。 OLTP 与 MySQL 同量级；复杂 SQL（窗口函数/CTE/多表关联）优化器更强 社区共识。 并行查询、BRIN/GIN 索引对分析型负载友好；写扩展同样靠分片（Citus 等）社区共识。 深水点：长事务导致表膨胀（bloat），VACUUM/自动清理策略直接影响性能稳定性 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（单机综合性能强；复杂查询优化器是长板）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>OLTP 与 MySQL 同量级；复杂 SQL（窗口函数/CTE/多表关联）优化器更强 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>并行查询、BRIN/GIN 索引对分析型负载友好；写扩展同样靠分片（Citus 等）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>深水点：长事务导致表膨胀（bloat），VACUUM/自动清理策略直接影响性能稳定性 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (strong single-node all-rounder; optimizer shines on complex queries). OLTP on par with MySQL; stronger optimizer for complex SQL (window functions, CTEs, multi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (strong single-node all-rounder; optimizer shines on complex queries).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>OLTP on par with MySQL; stronger optimizer for complex SQL (window functions, CTEs, multi-table joins) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Parallel queries and BRIN/GIN indexes help analytical workloads; write scaling still needs sharding (e.g. Citus) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Deep-water point: long transactions cause table bloat; VACUUM/autovacuum strategy directly affects performance stability <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（开源版无官方认证；合规靠部署方或发行版）。 社区版：无官方合规认证，等保/密评由部署方负责 社区共识。 商业发行版（EDB/各云 RDS）：各自持有云厂商或厂商的合规资质 厂商口径。 国际：各托管 PG 服务通常具备 SOC2/ISO27001（以云厂商公开页为准）厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（开源版无官方认证；合规靠部署方或发行版）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>社区版：无官方合规认证，等保/密评由部署方负责 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>商业发行版（EDB/各云 RDS）：各自持有云厂商或厂商的合规资质 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>国际：各托管 PG 服务通常具备 SOC2/ISO27001（以云厂商公开页为准）<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (no official certs for open source; via deployer or distribution). Community edition: no official compliance certifications; MLPS/crypto reviews are t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (no official certs for open source; via deployer or distribution).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Community edition: no official compliance certifications; MLPS/crypto reviews are the deployer&#x27;s job <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Commercial distributions (EDB, cloud RDS offerings) carry their vendor&#x27;s or cloud&#x27;s qualifications <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>International: managed PostgreSQL services typically hold SOC2/ISO 27001 (per providers&#x27; public pages) <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（1996 年发布；全球开发者社区驱动）。 源自 Berkeley Postgres，1996 年发布；无单一商业主导，全球开发者社区驱动 社区共识。 每年一个大版本（现 17/18 代），扩展生态（PostGIS/Citus/向量插件）最活跃 社区共识。 GitHub stars 万级；长期主义代表，版本兼容性口碑好 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（1996 年发布；全球开发者社区驱动）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>源自 Berkeley Postgres，1996 年发布；无单一商业主导，全球开发者社区驱动 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>每年一个大版本（现 17/18 代），扩展生态（PostGIS/Citus/向量插件）最活跃 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>GitHub stars 万级；长期主义代表，版本兼容性口碑好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (released 1996; global developer community driven). Descended from Berkeley Postgres, released 1996; no single commercial owner, driven by a global developer co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (released 1996; global developer community driven).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Descended from Berkeley Postgres, released 1996; no single commercial owner, driven by a global developer community <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Yearly major releases (now generations 17/18); the most active extension ecosystem (PostGIS, Citus, vector plugins) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Tens of thousands of GitHub stars; the long-termist&#x27;s choice with a strong compatibility reputation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Instagram/Reddit 等公开案例）。 Instagram、Reddit 等公开大规模 PG 用户 社区共识。 金融/政企去 O 迁移的首选目标之一 社区共识。 各云厂商 RDS PG 用户极多，间接证明 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Instagram/Reddit 等公开案例）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Instagram、Reddit 等公开大规模 PG 用户 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>金融/政企去 O 迁移的首选目标之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>各云厂商 RDS PG 用户极多，间接证明 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (public cases like Instagram/Reddit). Public large-scale users include Instagram and Reddit <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. A top target for off-Oracle migrations in fin…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (public cases like Instagram/Reddit).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public large-scale users include Instagram and Reddit <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>A top target for off-Oracle migrations in finance/government <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Huge managed-RDS PostgreSQL user counts across clouds, indirectly confirming adoption <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（备份/CDC/监控完整；迁移有 ora2pg）。 备份：pg_dump/pg_basebackup/pgBackRest/Barman 社区共识。 CDC：Debezium（逻辑复制）；迁移：ora2pg（Oracle→PG）社区共识。 监控：pg_exporter/PMM；连接池：PgBouncer/Pgpool 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（备份/CDC/监控完整；迁移有 ora2pg）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>备份：pg_dump/pg_basebackup/pgBackRest/Barman <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>CDC：Debezium（逻辑复制）；迁移：ora2pg（Oracle→PG）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>监控：pg_exporter/PMM；连接池：PgBouncer/Pgpool <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (complete backup/CDC/monitoring; ora2pg for migration). Backup: pg_dump, pg_basebackup, pgBackRest, Barman <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. CDC: Debezium (logical replica…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (complete backup/CDC/monitoring; ora2pg for migration).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup: pg_dump, pg_basebackup, pgBackRest, Barman <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>CDC: Debezium (logical replication); migration: ora2pg (Oracle→PG) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Monitoring: pg_exporter, PMM; pooling: PgBouncer, Pgpool <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（各云 RDS；Neon/Supabase 做 Serverless）。 各云厂商 RDS PG 全覆盖 社区共识。 Serverless：Neon（存算分离 Serverless PG）、Supabase 社区共识。 选择多，云中立性好，不易被单一厂商锁定 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（各云 RDS；Neon/Supabase 做 Serverless）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>各云厂商 RDS PG 全覆盖 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless：Neon（存算分离 Serverless PG）、Supabase <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>选择多，云中立性好，不易被单一厂商锁定 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (RDS on every cloud; Neon/Supabase do serverless). RDS PostgreSQL on every cloud vendor <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Serverless: Neon (disaggregated serverless PG), S…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (RDS on every cloud; Neon/Supabase do serverless).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>RDS PostgreSQL on every cloud vendor <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless: Neon (disaggregated serverless PG), Supabase <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Plenty of choice with good cloud neutrality — hard to get locked to one vendor <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（COPY 最快；pg_bulkload/pgloader）。 COPY 是单机最快导入通道；\\copy、file_fdw 读 CSV 官方文档。 pg_bulkload 并行 direct path 加载 社区共识。 pg_dump/pg_restore 逻辑迁移标准 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（COPY 最快；pg_bulkload/pgloader）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>COPY 是单机最快导入通道；\\copy、file_fdw 读 CSV <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>pg_bulkload 并行 direct path 加载 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>pg_dump/pg_restore 逻辑迁移标准 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (COPY is fastest; pg_bulkload/pgloader). COPY is the fastest single-node load path; \\copy and file_fdw read CSV <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. pg_bulkload for parallel direct…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (COPY is fastest; pg_bulkload/pgloader).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>COPY is the fastest single-node load path; \\copy and file_fdw read CSV <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>pg_bulkload for parallel direct-path loading <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>pg_dump/pg_restore is the logical-migration standard <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——内置 log_statement / log_min_duration_statement 等日志审计；细粒度审计靠 pgaudit 扩展。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——内置 <code>log_statement</code> / <code>log_min_duration_statement</code> 等日志审计；细粒度审计靠 pgaudit 扩展。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — built-in log-based auditing such as log_statement / log_min_duration_statement; fine-grained auditing via the pgaudit extension. Evidence: official …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — built-in log-based auditing such as <code>log_statement</code> / <code>log_min_duration_statement</code>; fine-grained auditing via the pgaudit extension. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（FDW 生态最强：postgres_fdw/file_fdw/dblink）。 postgres_fdw 可联邦查询远端 PG，下推谓词 官方文档。 file_fdw 读 CSV；dblink 做临时的跨库查询 官方文档。 社区 FDW（mysql_fdw、odbc_fdw 等）覆盖主流源 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（FDW 生态最强：postgres_fdw/file_fdw/dblink）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>postgres_fdw 可联邦查询远端 PG，下推谓词 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>file_fdw 读 CSV；dblink 做临时的跨库查询 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>社区 FDW（mysql_fdw、odbc_fdw 等）覆盖主流源 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Strongest FDW ecosystem: postgres_fdw/file_fdw/dblink). postgres_fdw federates into remote PG with predicate pushdown <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. file_fdw reads CSV; dbli…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Strongest FDW ecosystem: postgres_fdw/file_fdw/dblink).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>postgres_fdw federates into remote PG with predicate pushdown <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>file_fdw reads CSV; dblink for ad-hoc cross-database queries <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Community FDWs (mysql_fdw, odbc_fdw, etc.) cover mainstream sources <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（逻辑解码（pgoutput）生态最成熟）。 逻辑复制槽 + pgoutput，wal2json/test_decoding 可选 官方文档。 Debezium PG 连接器是事实标准 社区共识。 大事务解码延迟、slot 堆积涨 WAL 是已知运维点 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（逻辑解码（pgoutput）生态最成熟）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>逻辑复制槽 + pgoutput，wal2json/test_decoding 可选 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Debezium PG 连接器是事实标准 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>大事务解码延迟、slot 堆积涨 WAL 是已知运维点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Most mature logical-decoding (pgoutput) ecosystem). Logical replication slots + pgoutput; wal2json/test_decoding as options <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The Debezium PG co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Most mature logical-decoding (pgoutput) ecosystem).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Logical replication slots + pgoutput; wal2json/test_decoding as options <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The Debezium PG connector is the de-facto standard <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Decode lag on huge transactions and WAL growth from lagging slots are known ops concerns <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（声明式分区+pg_cron；无原生行级 TTL）。 声明式分区 + pg_partman/pg_cron 滚动删分区是社区最常用的组合 社区共识。 无原生行级 TTL；pg_cron 需装扩展，托管版一般自带 官方文档。 Beta 4 回退：PG 19 Beta 曾计划的 ALTER TABLE ... MERGE PARTIT…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（声明式分区+pg_cron；无原生行级 TTL）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>声明式分区 + pg_partman/pg_cron 滚动删分区是社区最常用的组合 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生行级 TTL；pg_cron 需装扩展，托管版一般自带 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<ul>\n<li><strong>Beta 4 回退</strong>：PG 19 Beta 曾计划的 <code>ALTER TABLE ... MERGE PARTITIONS</code> / <code>SPLIT PARTITIONS</code>（原生分区合并/拆分）在 Beta 4 被官方回退，留待后续大版本 <code>官方公告</code>；截至本稿，分区合并/拆分仍需用 DETACH/ATTACH 组合或重建表绕行 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Declarative partitioning + pg_cron; no native row-level TTL). Declarative partitioning with pg_partman/pg_cron for rolling drops is the most common community set…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Declarative partitioning + pg_cron; no native row-level TTL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Declarative partitioning with pg_partman/pg_cron for rolling drops is the most common community setup <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No native row-level TTL; pg_cron needs the extension (usually bundled in managed offerings) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.<ul>\n<li><strong>Reverted in Beta 4</strong>: the planned <code>ALTER TABLE ... MERGE PARTITIONS</code> / <code>SPLIT PARTITIONS</code> (native partition merge/split) was officially reverted in Beta 4 and deferred to a later major release <code>(official announcement)</code>; as of this writing, partition merge/split still requires DETACH/ATTACH combinations or table rebuilds <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（类1全在线/类2部分/类3需重建/类4支持两阶段；依据 PG 16/17 官方文档与 PG 19 Beta 4 公告）。 一、只改定义，不碰数据：加可空列、加带非 volatile 默认值的列（PG 11+ 只把默认值存进系统表元数据）、重命名、删列（打删除标记而非物理删除）、加 NOT VALID 约束、COMMENT，代价 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（类1全在线/类2部分/类3需重建/类4支持两阶段；依据 PG 16/17 官方文档与 PG 19 Beta 4 公告）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一、只改定义，不碰数据：加可空列、加带非 volatile 默认值的列（PG 11+ 只把默认值存进系统表元数据）、重命名、删列（打删除标记而非物理删除）、加 NOT VALID 约束、COMMENT，代价 O(1) 与表大小无关 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>二、重写数据，但数据住哪不变：改列类型、加带 volatile 默认值的列需全表+索引重写（binary coercible 等少数例外可免重写，但仍可能重建索引）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；VACUUM FULL/CLUSTER 全程拿 ACCESS EXCLUSIVE 锁，大表只能排窗口或走 pg_repack 等外部工具 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>；在线建索引靠 CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY（后台两遍扫描+增量追踪+原子切换；PG 12+ 还有 REINDEX CONCURRENTLY）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；PG 19 原生 <code>REPACK</code> 融合 VACUUM FULL + CLUSTER 语义，<code>REPACK CONCURRENTLY</code> 补上&quot;在线重整&quot;一环，但仍是 <strong>Beta 4</strong>——官方同期在修它的 crash 与无效索引/物化视图上的误行为，且它非 MVCC 安全（旧快照可能读到空表），GA 前必须用自己的 workload 实测 <code>官方公告</code>/<code>第三方测试</code>。</li>\n<li>三、搬数据：PG 是单机引擎，没有分布键；改分区键/分区策略、分区合并/拆分（PG 19 Beta 4 官方回退，仍需 DETACH/ATTACH 组合或重建绕行）、CLUSTER 按索引物理重排，都必须搬数据、不在线；例外是 DETACH PARTITION CONCURRENTLY（PG 14+，拿较轻的锁）<code>官方公告</code>/<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>四、验证约束：ADD CONSTRAINT ... NOT VALID 只加元数据不扫描，再 VALIDATE CONSTRAINT 两阶段验证；直接加 CHECK/NOT NULL/UNIQUE/FK 则全表扫描验证 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>规模：第二、四类代价 O(n)，官方文档明示大表重建&quot;耗时显著、临时需双倍磁盘&quot;——小表大表两个世界，&quot;测试环境在线、生产锁死&quot;的根源 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>语义：PG 的 DDL 大多是事务性的，失败可回滚 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>；但 CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY 是例外——不能在事务块里跑（分多事务执行、不可回滚的阶段）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；ALTER TABLE 拿 ACCESS EXCLUSIVE（最重的锁），长事务会卡住 DDL 拿锁、DDL 一旦排队又堵住后面所有访问 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Category 1 fully online / 2 partial / 3 requires rebuild / 4 two-phase; based on PG 16/17 official docs and the PG 19 Beta 4 announcement). 1. Defini…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Category 1 fully online / 2 partial / 3 requires rebuild / 4 two-phase; based on PG 16/17 official docs and the PG 19 Beta 4 announcement).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1. Definition-only changes (metadata, O(1)): adding nullable columns or columns with non-volatile defaults (since PG 11 the default is only stored in system-catalog metadata), renames, DROP COLUMN (tombstone mark, not physical removal), NOT VALID constraints, COMMENT — cost independent of table size <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>2. Data rewrite, location unchanged: changing column types or adding columns with volatile defaults rewrites the whole table and its indexes (a few binary-coercible exceptions skip the rewrite but may still rebuild indexes) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; VACUUM FULL / CLUSTER hold ACCESS EXCLUSIVE for the entire run — on huge tables that means a maintenance window or external tools like pg_repack <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>; online index builds use CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY (background double scan + incremental tracking + atomic swap; REINDEX CONCURRENTLY since PG 12) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; PG 19&#x27;s native <code>REPACK</code> merges VACUUM FULL + CLUSTER semantics and <code>REPACK CONCURRENTLY</code> closes the &quot;online rebuild&quot; gap, but it is still <strong>Beta 4</strong> — upstream is still fixing its crashes and invalid-index/materialized-view misbehavior, and it is not MVCC-safe (an old snapshot can see an empty table); test against your own workload before GA <code>(official announcement)</code> / <code>(third-party test)</code>.</li>\n<li>3. Data relocation: PG is a single-node engine with no distribution key; changing partition keys/strategy, partition merge/split (reverted in PG 19 Beta 4 — still needs DETACH/ATTACH combinations or rebuilds), and CLUSTER physical reordering all move data and are not online; the exception is DETACH PARTITION CONCURRENTLY (PG 14+, lighter lock) <code>(official announcement)</code> / <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>4. Constraint validation: ADD CONSTRAINT ... NOT VALID only touches metadata, then VALIDATE CONSTRAINT verifies in a second phase; adding CHECK / NOT NULL / UNIQUE / FK directly triggers a full-table validation scan <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Scale: categories 2 and 4 cost O(n); the docs warn that large-table rebuilds &quot;take a significant amount of time&quot; and &quot;temporarily require as much as double the disk space&quot; — small and huge tables are two different worlds, the root cause of &quot;online in staging, locked in production&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Semantics: most PG DDL is transactional and rolls back on failure <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>; CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY is the exception — it cannot run inside a transaction block (multi-transaction, non-rollbackable phases) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; ALTER TABLE takes ACCESS EXCLUSIVE (the heaviest lock) — a long transaction stalls DDL lock acquisition, and once DDL queues it blocks everything behind it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无原生资源组，靠外部手段）。 无原生 CPU/内存/IO 租户限流，statement_timeout 等是单查询保护 社区共识。 靠 cgroup、连接池、多实例做隔离，方案散 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无原生资源组，靠外部手段）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生 CPU/内存/IO 租户限流，statement_timeout 等是单查询保护 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>靠 cgroup、连接池、多实例做隔离，方案散 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native resource groups; external measures only). No native per-tenant CPU/memory/IO throttling; statement_timeout only guards single queries (community consen…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native resource groups; external measures only).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native per-tenant CPU/memory/IO throttling; statement_timeout only guards single queries <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Isolation via cgroups, pooling, multiple instances — fragmented approaches <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（逻辑复制/流复制跨区可配）。 流复制/逻辑复制可跨区，无原生多活写 社区共识。 双向逻辑复制冲突解决弱，生产慎用 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（逻辑复制/流复制跨区可配）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>流复制/逻辑复制可跨区，无原生多活写 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>双向逻辑复制冲突解决弱，生产慎用 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Logical/streaming replication across regions). Streaming/logical replication can span regions; no native active-active writes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Bidirectiona…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Logical/streaming replication across regions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Streaming/logical replication can span regions; no native active-active writes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Bidirectional logical replication has weak conflict handling; use cautiously <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（需 Patroni 等外部组件）。 原生无自动切换，靠 Patroni/Stolon，RTO 分钟级 社区共识。 同步备库可保 RPO=0，异步有丢数窗口 官方文档。 脑裂防护靠 fencing，配错会双主 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（需 Patroni 等外部组件）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>原生无自动切换，靠 Patroni/Stolon，RTO 分钟级 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>同步备库可保 RPO=0，异步有丢数窗口 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>脑裂防护靠 fencing，配错会双主 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Needs external components like Patroni). No native auto-failover; Patroni/Stolon give minutes of RTO <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Sync standbys keep RPO=0; async has a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Needs external components like Patroni).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native auto-failover; Patroni/Stolon give minutes of RTO <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Sync standbys keep RPO=0; async has a loss window <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Split-brain protection via fencing; misconfiguration yields dual primaries <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（原生RLS+列级权限，脱敏靠扩展）。 PostgreSQL 9.5+ 提供原生行级安全：CREATE POLICY 绑定表，按 current_user 等会话变量做行过滤 官方文档 支持列级权限 GRANT SELECT(col) 与 SECURITY DEFINER 视图封装；BYPASSRLS 权限须严格管控，否则策略被绕过 官…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（原生RLS+列级权限，脱敏靠扩展）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PostgreSQL 9.5+ 提供原生行级安全：CREATE POLICY 绑定表，按 current_user 等会话变量做行过滤 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>支持列级权限 GRANT SELECT(col) 与 SECURITY DEFINER 视图封装；BYPASSRLS 权限须严格管控，否则策略被绕过 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>动态脱敏无内置组件，通常靠 pg_anonymizer 扩展、视图 CASE 表达式或应用层实现 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>RLS 与分区表、外键、物化视图交互有坑：策略表达式性能差会拖慢查询，需实测 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native RLS + column grants; masking via extensions). PostgreSQL 9.5+ ships native row-level security: CREATE POLICY on tables filters rows by session variables…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native RLS + column grants; masking via extensions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PostgreSQL 9.5+ ships native row-level security: CREATE POLICY on tables filters rows by session variables like current_user <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Column-level GRANT SELECT(col) and SECURITY DEFINER views are supported; the BYPASSRLS privilege must be locked down or policies are bypassed <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No built-in dynamic masking; typically done with the pg_anonymizer extension, CASE expressions in views, or the app layer <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>RLS interacts poorly with partitioned tables, foreign keys, and materialized views; slow policy expressions drag down queries, so test in practice <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（jsonb 本家，GIN/jsonpath）。 jsonb 二进制、GIN（含 jsonb_path_ops）、SQL/JSON 路径语言 官方文档。 大 jsonb 局部更新整行重写，写放大注意 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（jsonb 本家，GIN/jsonpath）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>jsonb 二进制、GIN（含 jsonb_path_ops）、SQL/JSON 路径语言 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大 jsonb 局部更新整行重写，写放大注意 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (jsonb native, GIN/jsonpath). Native jsonb, GIN (incl. jsonb_path_ops), SQL/JSON path <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Partial updates rewrite whole row; write amplification (c…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (jsonb native, GIN/jsonpath).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Native jsonb, GIN (incl. jsonb_path_ops), SQL/JSON path <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Partial updates rewrite whole row; write amplification <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（tsvector 本家；中文需插件）。 tsvector/tsquery/GIN，排名高亮完备 官方文档。 中文分词需 zhparser 等插件 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（tsvector 本家；中文需插件）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>tsvector/tsquery/GIN，排名高亮完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>中文分词需 zhparser 等插件 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (tsvector native; CJK via plugins). tsvector/tsquery/GIN with ranking and highlighting <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Chinese needs zhparser-class plugins (community consensu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (tsvector native; CJK via plugins).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>tsvector/tsquery/GIN with ranking and highlighting <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Chinese needs zhparser-class plugins <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——SCRAM-SHA-256（默认）、LDAP / Kerberos / GSSAPI / SSPI / 证书认证；PG 18 新增 OAuth 2.0 认证；RBAC 角色模型。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（PG 18 release notes）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——SCRAM-SHA-256（默认）、LDAP / Kerberos / GSSAPI / SSPI / 证书认证；<strong>PG 18 新增 OAuth 2.0 认证</strong>；RBAC 角色模型。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（PG 18 release notes）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — SCRAM-SHA-256 (default), LDAP / Kerberos / GSSAPI / SSPI / certificate authentication; PG 18 adds OAuth 2.0 authentication; RBAC role model. Evidence: officia…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — SCRAM-SHA-256 (default), LDAP / Kerberos / GSSAPI / SSPI / certificate authentication; <strong>PG 18 adds OAuth 2.0 authentication</strong>; RBAC role model. Evidence: official docs (PG 18 release notes).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（TOAST 大对象压缩+列存扩展可选）。 TOAST 机制对大字段自动压缩（pglz）与行外存储，默认开启。官方文档 表级/列级压缩方法可选（pglz、lz4），PG14+ 支持自定义压缩算法。官方文档 行存架构在分析型负载下天然不如列存；可通过 Citus 列存、CStore_FDW 等扩展补足。社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（TOAST 大对象压缩+列存扩展可选）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TOAST 机制对大字段自动压缩（pglz）与行外存储，默认开启。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>表级/列级压缩方法可选（pglz、lz4），PG14+ 支持自定义压缩算法。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>行存架构在分析型负载下天然不如列存；可通过 Citus 列存、CStore_FDW 等扩展补足。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (TOAST large-object compression plus optional columnar extensions). TOAST automatically compresses (pglz) and out-of-line-stores large values; enabled by defaul…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (TOAST large-object compression plus optional columnar extensions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TOAST automatically compresses (pglz) and out-of-line-stores large values; enabled by default. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Per-table/per-column compression methods are selectable (pglz, lz4); PG14+ supports custom compression methods. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Row storage is inherently less efficient than columnar for analytics; extensions like Citus columnar or CStore_FDW close the gap. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（社区持有的 permissive 协议，无锁定）。 PostgreSQL 许可证是类 BSD 的宽松协议，由全球开发者社区持有，无单一商业公司控制权。官方文档 无协议变更黑历史；任何厂商发行版（包括云托管版）底层都是同一开源核心，可随时自建迁移。社区共识 商业扩展（如 EDB 的 Oracle 兼容层）属附加组件，不改变核心的开放属性…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（社区持有的 permissive 协议，无锁定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PostgreSQL 许可证是类 BSD 的宽松协议，由全球开发者社区持有，无单一商业公司控制权。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无协议变更黑历史；任何厂商发行版（包括云托管版）底层都是同一开源核心，可随时自建迁移。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>商业扩展（如 EDB 的 Oracle 兼容层）属附加组件，不改变核心的开放属性。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Community-held permissive license, no lock-in). The PostgreSQL License is a BSD-style permissive license held by the global developer community, with no si…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Community-held permissive license, no lock-in).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The PostgreSQL License is a BSD-style permissive license held by the global developer community, with no single commercial owner. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No license-change history; every vendor or cloud distribution is built on the same open core, so self-hosting migration is always an option. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Commercial add-ons (e.g. EDB&#x27;s Oracle compatibility layer) are optional components and do not change the core&#x27;s openness. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（CBO+GEQO；hint 需扩展；无冻结）。 CBO 完备（GEQO 处理多表 JOIN），EXPLAIN (ANALYZE/BUFFERS) 业界标杆 官方文档。 hint 需 pg_hint_plan 扩展，非官方内置 社区共识。 无计划冻结机制，统计信息过期致翻转是常见问题 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（CBO+GEQO；hint 需扩展；无冻结）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CBO 完备（GEQO 处理多表 JOIN），EXPLAIN (ANALYZE/BUFFERS) 业界标杆 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>hint 需 pg_hint_plan 扩展，非官方内置 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无计划冻结机制，统计信息过期致翻转是常见问题 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (CBO + GEQO; hints need pg_hint_plan; no freeze). Complete CBO (GEQO for many-table JOINs); EXPLAIN (ANALYZE/BUFFERS) is a benchmark <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Hints need…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (CBO + GEQO; hints need pg_hint_plan; no freeze).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete CBO (GEQO for many-table JOINs); EXPLAIN (ANALYZE/BUFFERS) is a benchmark <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Hints need the pg_hint_plan extension, not built-in <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No plan-freeze mechanism; stale statistics flips are common <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（参数约 350；autovacuum+诊断强）。 参数约 350 个，autovacuum 自动维护是亮点 官方文档。 pg_stat_statements、auto_explain 诊断生态完善 社区共识。 无自动索引，自治弱于商业库 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（参数约 350；autovacuum+诊断强）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>参数约 350 个，autovacuum 自动维护是亮点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>pg_stat_statements、auto_explain 诊断生态完善 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无自动索引，自治弱于商业库 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (~350 params; autovacuum + strong diagnostics). ~350 parameters; autovacuum auto-maintenance is a highlight <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. pg_stat_statements and auto_explain…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (~350 params; autovacuum + strong diagnostics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>~350 parameters; autovacuum auto-maintenance is a highlight <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>pg_stat_statements and auto_explain give a complete diagnostic ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No auto-indexing; less autonomous than commercial DBs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（data checksums 须初始化开启）。 data checksums 只能在 initdb --data-checksums 时开启，运行中无法追加；默认关闭是最大陷阱。官方文档 开启后读页即校验，损坏只报错不自愈，修复靠备份或逻辑复制重建。官方文档 云托管版（RDS/Aurora/AlloyDB）底层由云厂商校验，用户…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（data checksums 须初始化开启）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>data checksums 只能在 initdb --data-checksums 时开启，运行中无法追加；默认关闭是最大陷阱。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>开启后读页即校验，损坏只报错不自愈，修复靠备份或逻辑复制重建。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>云托管版（RDS/Aurora/AlloyDB）底层由云厂商校验，用户无开关可见。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><ul>\n<li><strong>Beta 4 回退</strong>：PG 19 Beta 曾计划支持运行中在线启用/禁用 data checksums（无需 initdb 重建），但在 Beta 4 被官方回退；截至本稿&quot;运行中无法追加&quot;仍成立，默认关闭仍是最大陷阱 <code>官方公告</code>。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Checksums opt-in at init; off by default). Data checksums can only be enabled with initdb --data-checksums and are off by default: the biggest gotcha. (official …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Checksums opt-in at init; off by default).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data checksums can only be enabled with initdb --data-checksums and are off by default: the biggest gotcha. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Once enabled, pages are verified on read; corruption raises errors without self-healing, and recovery needs backups or logical rebuild. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Managed cloud editions (RDS, Aurora, AlloyDB) add provider-level checks invisible to users. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><ul>\n<li><strong>Reverted in Beta 4</strong>: PG 19 Beta had planned online enabling/disabling of data checksums (at runtime, no initdb rebuild), but the feature was officially reverted in Beta 4; as of this writing, &quot;cannot be added while the server runs&quot; still holds and off-by-default remains the biggest gotcha <code>(official announcement)</code>.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（plpgsql 成熟，多过程语言）。 plpgsql 异常处理、调试成熟，plpython/plperl 等多语言 官方文档。 去 O 迁移：包/自治事务需改写，EDB/ora2pg 辅助 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（plpgsql 成熟，多过程语言）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>plpgsql 异常处理、调试成熟，plpython/plperl 等多语言 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>去 O 迁移：包/自治事务需改写，EDB/ora2pg 辅助 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Mature plpgsql, many languages). Mature plpgsql with exceptions/debugging; plpython/plperl etc. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Oracle migration: packages/autonomous txn need…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Mature plpgsql, many languages).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Mature plpgsql with exceptions/debugging; plpython/plperl etc. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Oracle migration: packages/autonomous txn need rewrites; EDB/ora2pg help <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（约束最完备：EXCLUDE/deferrable）。 FK、CHECK、EXCLUDE、deferrable，语义最完备 官方文档。 大表加带验证约束锁表是在线 DDL 话题 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（约束最完备：EXCLUDE/deferrable）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FK、CHECK、EXCLUDE、deferrable，语义最完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大表加带验证约束锁表是在线 DDL 话题 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Most complete: EXCLUDE/deferrable). FK, CHECK, EXCLUDE, deferrable — most complete semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Validated constraints on huge tables lock; an onl…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Most complete: EXCLUDE/deferrable).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FK, CHECK, EXCLUDE, deferrable — most complete semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Validated constraints on huge tables lock; an online-DDL topic <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（分析 SQL 完备标杆）。 窗口函数、CTE（含递归）、GROUPING SETS 完备 官方文档。 复杂分析优化器成熟 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（分析 SQL 完备标杆）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>窗口函数、CTE（含递归）、GROUPING SETS 完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>复杂分析优化器成熟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Analytical SQL benchmark). Window functions, CTEs (incl. recursive), GROUPING SETS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Mature optimizer for complex analytics (community consensus…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Analytical SQL benchmark).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Window functions, CTEs (incl. recursive), GROUPING SETS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Mature optimizer for complex analytics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（手动DELETE为主；VACUUM前页内残留）。 DELETE 只标记 dead tuple，VACUUM 之前旧版本仍在数据文件中，可被取证恢复；VACUUM FULL / CLUSTER 可物理重写 官方文档 WAL 归档、流复制从库、基础备份都会保留被删行的历史副本，擦除需全链路轮转 社区共识 无原生“擦除证明”或 GDP…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（手动DELETE为主；VACUUM前页内残留）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE 只标记 dead tuple，VACUUM 之前旧版本仍在数据文件中，可被取证恢复；VACUUM FULL / CLUSTER 可物理重写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>WAL 归档、流复制从库、基础备份都会保留被删行的历史副本，擦除需全链路轮转 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无原生“擦除证明”或 GDPR 工作流，合规靠应用层审计日志记录删除动作 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>分区表 DROP 分区是最高效的批量擦除手段，但粒度只到分区 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Manual DELETE; residue until VACUUM). DELETE only marks dead tuples; before VACUUM the old row versions remain in data files and are forensically recoverable; VA…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Manual DELETE; residue until VACUUM).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE only marks dead tuples; before VACUUM the old row versions remain in data files and are forensically recoverable; VACUUM FULL / CLUSTER rewrites physically <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>WAL archives, streaming replicas, and base backups all retain historical copies of deleted rows; erasure needs full-pipeline rotation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No native erasure attestation or GDPR workflow; compliance relies on app-layer audit logging of deletes <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>DROP PARTITION is the most efficient bulk erasure, but granularity stops at the partition <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无原生；DataHub 采集 PG 元数据）。 无原生血缘，DataHub/Atlan 可采集 PG 元数据 社区共识。 pg_stat_statements 可作为血缘推断数据源 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无原生；DataHub 采集 PG 元数据）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生血缘，DataHub/Atlan 可采集 PG 元数据 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>pg_stat_statements 可作为血缘推断数据源 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native; DataHub harvests PG metadata). No native lineage; DataHub/Atlan can harvest PG metadata <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. pg_stat_statements can feed lineage inf…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native; DataHub harvests PG metadata).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native lineage; DataHub/Atlan can harvest PG metadata <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>pg_stat_statements can feed lineage inference <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——pg_basebackup + WAL 归档实现 PITR；pg_restore / pg_dump 逻辑备份；PG 17+ 支持增量备份（pg_basebackup --incremental）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——<code>pg_basebackup</code> + WAL 归档实现 PITR；<code>pg_restore</code> / <code>pg_dump</code> 逻辑备份；<strong>PG 17+ 支持增量备份</strong>（<code>pg_basebackup --incremental</code>）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — pg_basebackup + WAL archiving for PITR; pg_restore / pg_dump for logical backups; PG 17+ supports incremental backup (pg_basebackup --incremental). Evidence: …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — <code>pg_basebackup</code> + WAL archiving for PITR; <code>pg_restore</code> / <code>pg_dump</code> for logical backups; <strong>PG 17+ supports incremental backup</strong> (<code>pg_basebackup --incremental</code>). Evidence: official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（开源版存算一体；云托管多分离）。 开源版经典本地盘存算一体 官方文档。 云托管版（RDS/Aurora/AlloyDB）多为存算分离 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（开源版存算一体；云托管多分离）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源版经典本地盘存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>云托管版（RDS/Aurora/AlloyDB）多为存算分离 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (OSS coupled; cloud-hosted mostly split). OSS edition is classic local-disk coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cloud-hosted editions (RDS/Aurora/AlloyDB) are mostly disag…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (OSS coupled; cloud-hosted mostly split).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>OSS edition is classic local-disk coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cloud-hosted editions (RDS/Aurora/AlloyDB) are mostly disaggregated <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（一库多用标杆：jsonb+全文+GIS+向量）。 jsonb(GIN)、全文检索、PostGIS、pgvector，扩展生态最强 官方文档。 多模能力是 PG 护城河 社区共识。 图查询（SQL/PGQ）：PG 19 Beta 曾计划的 property graph 查询支持在 Beta 4 被官方回退，理由是可靠性与排期优先、留待后…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（一库多用标杆：jsonb+全文+GIS+向量）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>jsonb(GIN)、全文检索、PostGIS、pgvector，扩展生态最强 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多模能力是 PG 护城河 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>图查询（SQL/PGQ）：PG 19 Beta 曾计划的 property graph 查询支持在 Beta 4 被官方回退，理由是可靠性与排期优先、留待后续大版本 <code>官方公告</code>；图场景仍需专用图库或扩展实现 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Multi-model benchmark: jsonb + FTS + PostGIS + vectors). jsonb (GIN), full-text, PostGIS, pgvector; strongest extension ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Multi-model …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Multi-model benchmark: jsonb + FTS + PostGIS + vectors).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>jsonb (GIN), full-text, PostGIS, pgvector; strongest extension ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Multi-model breadth is PG&#x27;s moat <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Graph queries (SQL/PGQ): the planned property-graph query support in PG 19 Beta was officially reverted in Beta 4, with reliability and release-schedule priority cited and the feature deferred to a later major release <code>(official announcement)</code>; graph workloads still need dedicated graph databases or extensions <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（自建无计费，成本=硬件+调优人力自理）。 PostgreSQL 无内置计费概念，成本是硬件与运维/调优人力。社区共识 云托管版可用云账单标签与预算告警做成本归因。厂商口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（自建无计费，成本=硬件+调优人力自理）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PostgreSQL 无内置计费概念，成本是硬件与运维/调优人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>云托管版可用云账单标签与预算告警做成本归因。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No metering; hardware plus labor). PostgreSQL has no built-in metering; costs are hardware and operations/tuning labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> Managed cloud editions …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No metering; hardware plus labor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PostgreSQL has no built-in metering; costs are hardware and operations/tuning labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Managed cloud editions support cost attribution via cloud billing tags and budget alerts. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（libpq/pgjdbc/psqlODBC 完备）。 libpq、pgjdbc、psqlODBC 官方完备 官方文档。 各语言驱动质量高 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（libpq/pgjdbc/psqlODBC 完备）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>libpq、pgjdbc、psqlODBC 官方完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>各语言驱动质量高 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (libpq/pgjdbc/psqlODBC; complete per-language). Complete official libpq, pgjdbc, psqlODBC <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. High-quality drivers across languages (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (libpq/pgjdbc/psqlODBC; complete per-language).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete official libpq, pgjdbc, psqlODBC <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>High-quality drivers across languages <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（手动 REFRESH 为主）。 物化视图 REFRESH（含 CONCURRENTLY）手动 官方文档。 无自动增量刷新/改写，pg_ivm 等扩展非官方 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（手动 REFRESH 为主）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>物化视图 REFRESH（含 CONCURRENTLY）手动 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无自动增量刷新/改写，pg_ivm 等扩展非官方 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Manual REFRESH mainly). Manual REFRESH (incl. CONCURRENTLY) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No auto incremental refresh/rewrite; pg_ivm is third-party <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Manual REFRESH mainly).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Manual REFRESH (incl. CONCURRENTLY) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No auto incremental refresh/rewrite; pg_ivm is third-party <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（开源任意云，无绑定）。 开源版任意云/自建可部署，是跨云自由度最高的数据库之一 官方文档。 各云托管 PG 差异小，迁云成本低 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（开源任意云，无绑定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源版任意云/自建可部署，是跨云自由度最高的数据库之一 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>各云托管 PG 差异小，迁云成本低 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Open source on any cloud; no binding). Open source deploys on any cloud/self-hosted — among the freest databases for cross-cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Managed PG of…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Open source on any cloud; no binding).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open source deploys on any cloud/self-hosted — among the freest databases for cross-cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Managed PG offerings differ little; moving clouds is cheap <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（行锁排队串行，HOT 只降写放大）。 并发控制原语：UPDATE 与 SELECT FOR UPDATE 对同一行互斥，后来者阻塞排队直到持锁者提交或回滚；MVCC 下常规的行读不阻塞写、写不阻塞读（DDL、唯一性检查等是例外），只有写者在同一行上串行 社区共识。 冲突行为：锁等待成环经 deadlock_timeout（默认 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（行锁排队串行，HOT 只降写放大）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发控制原语：UPDATE 与 SELECT FOR UPDATE 对同一行互斥，后来者阻塞排队直到持锁者提交或回滚；MVCC 下常规的行读不阻塞写、写不阻塞读（DDL、唯一性检查等是例外），只有写者在同一行上串行 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>冲突行为：锁等待成环经 deadlock_timeout（默认 1s）检测后报 40P01 并回滚其中一个事务；可用 lock_timeout 设等待上限快速失败，失败后由应用层重试 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>HOT 与高频更新：未改索引列且页内有空位时，HOT 更新避免为每个行版本重写全部索引项、降低写放大；但 HOT 不缓解锁竞争，热点行仍是行锁串行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解：未找到官方命名或文档化的热点行机制的证据；fillfactor 降到 70–90 可提高 HOT 命中率，代价是表变大、顺序读放大多，属于空间换时间的静态调优而非自适应机制 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减与应用层：热点行吞吐上限约等于单事务持锁周期的倒数，长事务或 idle in transaction 持锁会引发排队雪崩；社区做法是短事务、原子 UPDATE（如 counter=counter+1 缩短持锁）、计数器侧表、SKIP LOCKED（仅适用于多行分发，对单行热点无效），代价是建模与重试逻辑侵入业务 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Row locks serialize hot rows; HOT only reduces write amplification). Locking primitive: UPDATE and SELECT FOR UPDATE are mutually exclusive on the sa…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Row locks serialize hot rows; HOT only reduces write amplification).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Locking primitive: UPDATE and SELECT FOR UPDATE are mutually exclusive on the same row; later writers block and queue until the holder commits or rolls back. Under MVCC, ordinary row reads never block writers nor writers readers (DDL, uniqueness checks and the like are exceptions) — only writers serialize on the same row <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Conflict behavior: a lock-wait cycle is detected after <code>deadlock_timeout</code> (default 1s) and aborts one transaction with error 40P01; <code>lock_timeout</code> caps the wait so statements fail fast, and the application retries <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>HOT and frequent updates: when no indexed column changes and the page has free space, HOT updates avoid rewriting every index entry per row version, reducing write amplification; but HOT does nothing for lock contention — the hot row still serializes on row locks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation: no evidence of an officially named or documented hot-row mechanism; lowering <code>fillfactor</code> to 70–90 raises the HOT hit rate at the cost of a larger table and more sequential-read amplification — a static space-for-time tuning, not an adaptive mechanism (to be verified).</li>\n<li>Degradation and application patterns: hot-row throughput caps at roughly the inverse of a single transaction&#x27;s lock-hold time, and long or idle-in-transaction lock holders trigger queue pile-ups; community practice is short transactions, atomic UPDATEs (e.g. <code>counter=counter+1</code> to shorten lock holding), side counter tables, and SKIP LOCKED (only spreads multi-row queues — useless for single-row hotspots), at the cost of modeling and retry logic leaking into business code <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——pg_stat_* 视图族、pg_stat_statements（contrib）、auto_explain、EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——<code>pg_stat_*</code> 视图族、<code>pg_stat_statements</code>（contrib）、<code>auto_explain</code>、EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS)。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — the pg_stat_* view family, pg_stat_statements (contrib), auto_explain, EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS). Evidence: official docs.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — the <code>pg_stat_*</code> view family, <code>pg_stat_statements</code> (contrib), <code>auto_explain</code>, EXPLAIN (ANALYZE, BUFFERS). Evidence: official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（进程模型）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（进程模型）——每连接一个后端 OS 进程；高并发必须配连接池（PgBouncer）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（进程模型）</strong>——每连接一个后端 OS 进程；高并发必须配连接池（PgBouncer）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (process model) — one backend OS process per connection; high concurrency requires a connection pooler (PgBouncer). Evidence: official docs + community consensu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (process model)</strong> — one backend OS process per connection; high concurrency requires a connection pooler (PgBouncer). Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——单机强一致；MVCC；Read Committed（默认）、Repeatable Read、Serializable；DDL 具有事务性（可在事务块中回滚）；崩溃恢复可靠（WAL + checkpoint）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——单机强一致；MVCC；Read Committed（默认）、Repeatable Read、Serializable；<strong>DDL 具有事务性</strong>（可在事务块中回滚）；崩溃恢复可靠（WAL + checkpoint）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — strong consistency on a single node; MVCC; Read Committed (default), Repeatable Read, Serializable; DDL is transactional (can be rolled back inside a transact…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — strong consistency on a single node; MVCC; Read Committed (default), Repeatable Read, Serializable; <strong>DDL is transactional</strong> (can be rolled back inside a transaction block); reliable crash recovery (WAL + checkpoint). Evidence: official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——流复制（异步/同步，支持级联）、逻辑复制（含 PG 16+ 双向逻辑复制）、内置逻辑解码。无原生自动故障切换（查证为无，靠 Patroni / Stolon / 云托管实现）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——流复制（异步/同步，支持级联）、逻辑复制（含 PG 16+ 双向逻辑复制）、内置逻辑解码。<strong>无</strong>原生自动故障切换（查证为无，靠 Patroni / Stolon / 云托管实现）。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — streaming replication (async/sync, cascading supported), logical replication (including bidirectional logical replication since PG 16), built-in logical decod…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — streaming replication (async/sync, cascading supported), logical replication (including bidirectional logical replication since PG 16), built-in logical decoding. <strong>No</strong> native automatic failover (confirmed absent; rely on Patroni / Stolon / managed services). Evidence: official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});